# Feature Engineering Implementation - Complete Walkthrough

## Summary

Successfully implemented comprehensive feature engineering system with **55 features** calculated entirely from real 1-minute OHLC data. The system includes:

- ✅ Black-Scholes option pricing (replacing simplified model)
- ✅ Multiple volatility estimators (Rolling, Parkinson, Garman-Klass)
- ✅ Second-order Greeks (Vanna, Volga) for volatility sensitivity
- ✅ Technical indicators (RSI, MACD, Bollinger, ATR)
- ✅ Multi-timeframe analysis (1-min, 5-min, 15-min, 30-min)
- ✅ NO simulated data - everything from real market data
- ✅ NO volume features (indices have no volume)

