## Data Requirements

### Input Data Format (1-minute OHLC)

Your CSV files must contain:
```
datetime,open,high,low,close,volume
2024-01-01 09:30:00,21500.0,21510.0,21495.0,21505.0,0
2024-01-01 09:31:00,21505.0,21515.0,21500.0,21512.0,0
...
```

**Important Notes**:
- ✅ Volume column can be 0 (indices don't have volume)
- ✅ Datetime format: `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`
- ✅ Time range: 9:30 AM to 3:15 PM
- ✅ Frequency: 1-minute bars
- ✅ ~345 bars per trading day

