## Volatility-Driven Strategy Support

Your insight about volatility-driven strategies is now fully supported:

| Volatility Regime | Features That Detect It | Optimal Action |
|-------------------|------------------------|----------------|
| **High Volatility** | • High rolling vol<br>• High Parkinson/GK vol<br>• Vol percentile > 0.7<br>• High Vega exposure | **Long Straddle**<br>Profit from large moves |
| **Low Volatility** | • Low rolling vol<br>• Vol percentile < 0.3<br>• High positive Theta<br>• Low Vanna/Volga | **Short Straddle**<br>Profit from time decay |
| **Increasing Vol** | • Positive vol trend<br>• High vol of vol<br>• IV > Realized | **Prepare for long**<br>Volatility expansion coming |
| **Decreasing Vol** | • Negative vol trend<br>• Low vol of vol<br>• IV < Realized | **Prepare for short**<br>Volatility contraction |

The model will learn these patterns automatically from the 55 features!

