## Technical Notes

### Performance Optimizations

- Vectorized numpy operations for speed
- Feature caching in [FeatureCalculator](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Desktop/MAI/Thesis/Code/Deep-Hedging/rl_directional_straddle/utils/feature_calculator.py#22-347)
- NaN/Inf handling with `np.nan_to_num()`
- Normalized features for stable training

### Edge Case Handling

- Insufficient data at day start → return zeros
- Division by zero → safe_divide() with default values
- Time to expiry near zero → intrinsic value only
- Missing historical data → use available data only

